# Bulk retrieved third-party source material is NOT committed: it would bloat the
# repository and its redistribution rights vary per publisher. What IS committed:
# the derived extraction, the manifests, the coverage log, the candidate table,
# the correction record, and staged_inventory.csv -- which records every retrieved
# file with its sha256, byte count, original filename, retrieval URL and inner
# file/sheet inventory, so any of it can be re-fetched and verified.
#
# The one full-content exception is the Sewing 2017 S1 workbook: a small CC-BY
# supplement that is the direct input to the scientist-approved mechanistic lane.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!sewing2017_pone.0187574_S1.xlsx
!sewing2017_condition_level.csv
!sewing2017_manifest.json
!search_coverage_log.csv
!sweep_all_resource_rows.csv
!acquisition_candidates.csv
!sweep_corrections.csv
!staged_inventory.csv
!sweep_*.json
